  abstract = {The combination of artificial intelligence (AI) technology supported by big data and cloud computing with medical field shows a broad application prospect. The excellent imaging recognition ability of AI is very suitable for the diagnosis and recognition of upper digestive tract diseases, thereby reducing the missed diagnosis and helping physicians to perform endoscopy better. This article reviewed the application of AI in diagnosis of upper digestive tract diseases, especially for the early recognition of cancer. COPYRIGHT © 2020 by the Editorial Office of Chinese Journal of Gastroenterology.},
